_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZLrqw4KCwKyBlVqycUfNbg","review_id":"5q3wFSeOek_izYNFo4vWlg","date":"2018-05-13T00:17:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.93367999792099,"text_excerpt":"Such a perfect location! It's at a Y in the road on the bottom of the French Quarter not far off Jackson Square or Frenchmen's Street. They have indoor and patio seating. We opted to sit outside so we could hear the live band and people watch on our last night. We started with drinks. A Bloody Mary for him and a Mango specialty drink for me. Both were good but not special like the rave reviews. For an appetizer we had the Mediterranean Hummus and pita with tomatoes and feta. Do yourself a favor, don't make the same mistake. Do you remember the frito bean dip that comes in a small can for dipping Fritos in? I strongly suspect that this is what we had. It was super thick and pretty tasteles..."},{"business_id":"ZLrqw4KCwKyBlVqycUfNbg","review_id":"87dup_qLVsCUdIpHhus9LQ","date":"2012-03-28T21:29:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9311615228652954,"text_excerpt":"I can't vouch for the whole menu, but the crawfish boil was off the hook here. The broth is spicy as hell (A.K.A. DELICIOUS) so be careful that it doesn't hit the back of your throat when you are slurping the juice from the head. (There is no way I can make that sound non-sexual, is there? This sentence was my third try.) It also helps that The Market Cafe sits in a great location, has live music, and has a sweet patio too. The prices are decent as well. I will definitely be back next time I'm in New Orleans."},{"business_id":"ZLrqw4KCwKyBlVqycUfNbg","review_id":"PZApxn_HoGQ0vFpwJPCv4Q","date":"2015-03-31T14:01:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9282345175743103,"text_excerpt":"While wondering around the French Quarter, we smelled something delicious and followed our noses here. The live band out front is what ultimately lead us to stay and eat. Glad we did! This place is perfect for what is. An open air cafe with an incredible live jazz band, an unforgettable muffuletta sandwich, and strong drinks. We ordered two hurricanes, (why not), half a muffuletta, and the jambalaya. Little had the chicken strips and a soda. I've never had a hurricane before but I can tell you- this is how it should taste. Strong, fruity, refreshing, delicious, and kinda like if you had more then one you might just keel over. If you know me at all, you know I LOVE sandwiches. So much. Thi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZLrqw4KCwKyBlVqycUfNbg","photo_id":"fVfJnkIRMxQXTk-f0Kq_CQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fVfJnkIRMxQXTk-f0Kq_CQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9164741635322571},{"business_id":"ZLrqw4KCwKyBlVqycUfNbg","photo_id":"crZEpQaVLX8wJ-MT06tv8g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/crZEpQaVLX8wJ-MT06tv8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8901839256286621},{"business_id":"ZLrqw4KCwKyBlVqycUfNbg","photo_id":"qwIDkodT9i-98015jpjSkA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qwIDkodT9i-98015jpjSkA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8727299571037292},{"business_id":"ZLrqw4KCwKyBlVqycUfNbg","photo_id":"6WK-6YhfxjcdSHRwehAY8Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6WK-6YhfxjcdSHRwehAY8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness